.SH NAME
QListBoxItem \- This is the base class of all list box items
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qlistbox.h>\fR
.PP
Inherited by QListBoxPixmap and QListBoxText.
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
